# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Orc Horde, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 124.5 h -> 116.8 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.

# Built from the playthrough simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits
# 80-85) and machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Orgrimmar (Jes'rimon, Blackhoof) -> fly to the Crossroads (Dokimi's
# crates) -> fly to Ratchet (Liv Rizzlefix, Marvon's Chest) -> fly to
# Orgrimmar (cloth donations) -> fly to Valormok (Jediga's payments, Ag'tor)
# -> Ruins of Eldarath (Cuely's vials) -> Thalassian Base Camp and Magus
# Rimtori -> Valormok -> fly to Orgrimmar (Belgrom) -> zeppelin to the
# Undercity (Cuely, Bauhaus, Jeremiah, Owen Thadd, Alessandro Luca).
#
# Wand to Bethor (491), which the export turns in here, is left out: the
# earlier guide no longer accepts it.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Dropped: For Great Honor (8367, 8388: battleground quests), and the
#   Ashenvale stop (visit 82), whose only "objectives" are the Silk
#   donations: cloth carried in your bags.
# - The Crossroads and Undercity binds are dropped (each replaced at once).
# - The export ends Azshara with a hearth to Ratchet and comes back through
#   Orgrimmar much later to report Betrayed (3507). Here you fly from
#   Valormok straight to Orgrimmar, hand Betrayed to Belgrom on the way to
#   the Undercity zeppelin, and keep the hearth; the Ratchet bind goes with it.
#
# Left open for later guides: Taking Back Silithus (8276), The Stone Circle
# (3444, Marvon in Tanaris), Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood (5159, the
# Emerald Sanctuary), the Runecloth donations (7824, 7836) and Good Luck
# Charm (5050, Janice in the Western Plaguelands).
#
# Dropped: Volcanic Activity (4502): the later guides no longer hand it in
# (Un'Goro ash detour).
#
# Class quests: Hunters' The Hunter's Charm (8151-8232, Ogtinc) is a Class
# guide (forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm): Morphaz in the Sunken
# Temple holds its last part.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 4300                         -- Jes'rimon, the Cleft of Shadow
  sethome "Orgrimmar"
  accept 8276                         -- Cenarion Emissary Blackhoof, Valley of Wisdom: keep it for Silithus
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Fly to Ratchet
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Ratchet"
  zone The Barrens

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Barrens

step Dokimi's crates
  tip Dokimi stands in the Crossroads. Open each crate she hands you and bring back what is inside.
  accept 91899
  complete 91899
  turnin 91899
  accept 91904
  complete 91904
  turnin 91904

step Liv Rizzlefix
  tip Liv's workshop is at the north end of Ratchet's docks; Marvon's Chest stands inside it.
  turnin 4147                         -- Inside
  collect 10556 quest 3444.1          -- Stone Circle: Marvon's Chest

step Islen Waterseer
  tip Islen camps on the shore just north of Ratchet.
  turnin 5158
  accept 5159
  note Cleansed Water goes to the Emerald Sanctuary in Felwood: keep it for later.

step Hearth to Orgrimmar
  hearth "Orgrimmar"

step Fly to Valormok
  zone Orgrimmar
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Valormok"
  zone Azshara

step Valormok
  turnin 3504                         -- Ag'tor Bloodfist
  accept 3505
  turnin 3564
  turnin 3563
  turnin 3562                         -- Jediga

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Valormok

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone Azshara
  goto 21.9,49.7 "Valormok flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"

step Vehena
  when onquest 7833,7834,7835
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip In the Valley of Spirits. Each donation takes sixty Wool, Silk or Mageweave from your bags: hand in what you carry, skip the rest.
  turnin 7833 optional
  turnin 7834 optional
  turnin 7835 optional

step Rashona Straglash
  when onquest 7826,7827,7831
  tip In the Valley of Honor.
  turnin 7826 optional
  turnin 7827 optional
  turnin 7831 optional
  note Both Runecloth donations are handed in later in the route: save sixty Runecloth for each if you want them.

step Ruins of Eldarath
  when onquest 3568
  zone Azshara
  tip Ride east to the ruins on the coast. Fill Cuely's four vials at the tide pools along the shore; Spitelash naga patrol between them.
  goto 35.0,55.0 "Ruins of Eldarath"
  complete 3568

step Thalassian Base Camp
  tip The blood elves camp on the cliffs in the north-east, by the Bay of Storms.
  kill 6199 quest 3505.1
  kill 6198 quest 3505.2

step Magus Rimtori's camp
  tip Rimtori's camp is at the east end of the base camp. Read the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning there, then kill the Magus.
  tip Careful: Which crystal is linked to Rimtori is random. Each of the other two summons a hostile infernal instead.
  complete 3505 @59.53,31.47 era
  turnin 3505                         -- Kaldorei Tome of Summoning
  accept 3506
  collect 10597 quest 3506            -- Magus Rimtori

step Ag'tor Bloodfist
  tip Ride back west to Valormok.
  turnin 3506
  accept 3507

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone Azshara
  goto 22.0,49.7 "Valormok flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Class trainer
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Paladin trainer
  only Paladin
  train class only Paladin -- Alodan the Hopeful in Thunder Bluff; Orgrimmar has no paladin trainer

step Druid trainer
  only Druid
  train class only Druid -- Sheal Runetotem in Mulgore; Orgrimmar has no druid trainer

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar and the Undercity

step Belgrom Rockmaul
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly to Orgrimmar; Belgrom is in the Valley of Honor.
  turnin 3507

step Into Durotar
  zone Durotar
  goto 45.5,12.3 "Into Durotar"

step Zeppelin to Undercity
  zone Durotar
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin to Undercity"

step Prompt Potion Runner
  zone Undercity
  accept 97891                        -- Alessandro Luca

step Owen Thadd
  accept 79095 optional               -- Only with The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer from Brill's alchemy shop in your bags (the Library Books guide)
  turnin 79095 optional
  turnin 5023                         -- Royal Overseer Bauhaus
  accept 5049
  turnin 5049                         -- Jeremiah Payson, nearby

step The Apothecarium
  zone Undercity
  turnin 3568                         -- Chemist Cuely
  accept 3569
  turnin 3569                         -- Thersa Windsong, beside him
  accept 3570 npc 8390
  turnin 3570
  turnin 97891                        -- Doctor Martin Felben, in the Apothecarium

step Royal Quarter
  accept 5050
  note Good Luck Charm goes back to Janice Felstone in the Western Plaguelands: keep it.